 de queda livre e o jogo da marreta.", "short_description": "Epic Fun \u00e9 um conjunto de atra\u00e7\u00f5es inspiradas em parques tem\u00e1ticos.\n\nAs montanhas-russas s\u00e3o nossas principais atra\u00e7\u00f5es! S\u00e3o seis no total e cada uma possui tem\u00e1tica \u00fanica e acompanha um exclusivo jogo de tiro sobre trilhos!\n\nN\u00e3o deixe de testar o seu medo de altura em nossa torre de queda livre, e fazer um tranquilo passeio em nossa roda gigante repleta de eventos.\n\nCompita pela melhor posi\u00e7\u00e3o nas diferentes classifica\u00e7\u00f5es de cada um dos tr\u00eas jogos: Tiro, Dardo e Marreta."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2224673754494019", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982624_1231508220367103_115557499553185792_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Iiuq6u4EZ_QQ7kNvwH-pEcX&_nc_oc=Adk0A-mdCaEEiPERMyjJdhrMupRwHsBhzE5Bt-qv7Nwd3yY91UtZYH-0L-szCd0DHgY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsonaC4Z-6mHNDOBGj5oiIrsyyo7xZ3WIoT3MloDOrR5A&oe=69A19E16"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "684007619008344", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031490_729985627444273_5976286068549353472_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UrjAKlbS24sQ7kNvwEoeO0q&_nc_oc=AdlYwAt8d7DK3xsw2kCVLpY_x8jjrcBq3b-wXGM8sYNutPV5TW7ZqUCOndhOKdTcYWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfupYFUH3is-0VTVKTdso0YaGNtBwm2F7cve0oB9kH_sQg&oe=69A193CF"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "604787070105792", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984456_474861886688494_5451184045545226240_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wDXhnERiwRYQ7kNvwEWgsMq&_nc_oc=AdmQRwPJdShEDfuNMSd5k9xea_3Z0nODFsNjxOJQyUMHS9uiklr6DqDgSd8K-T7x69I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvPkCh8qD38MfxOQq8ztok1ar